SUMMARY:Czech that Film - Caravan
DTSTART:20260614T003000Z
DTEND:20260614T024000Z
DTSTAMP:20260614T003000Z
UID:uPv902j7FV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nPresented by Honorary Consulate
  of the Czech Republic in Seattle and Center for Czech Education and Cultu
 re  Czech That Film returns after five years with Caravan — a tender Cz
 ech road movie about Ester\, a devoted mother to David\, her son with Down
  syndrome. When she flees a tense Italian visit\, their old camper becomes
  a journey toward freedom\, connection\, and unexpected joy.\n\nhttps://ww
 w.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/czech-that-film-caravan\n\nEstimated start: 
 17:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
